claim.claim-text:
an outer shell (54) having a first end (52) and a second end (50), the outer shell (54) being shaped to define an interior lumen (58);
a cap (54a) comprising a central aperture defining a region of drug release (56), the cap (54a) fitted to the first end (52) of the outer shell (54), the region of drug release (56) configured to elute a drug; and
a membrane (60) comprising elastic properties configured to retain the cap (54a) onto the outer shell (54).
